{"jsonrpc": "2.0", "id": 13, "result": {"content": [{"type": "text", "text": "error (ambiguous): sin(x) has special points at the interval's ends (at x = 0 it is 0): near a zero, relative error is unbounded unless the zero is exact; keep them exact (costs some error elsewhere)\nambiguous: set args.assume.keep_ends to one of:\n  1) yes, keep them exact (keep endpoints)\n  2) no, fit freely (default)\nrepeat the request with args.assume.keep_ends set to a reading (or its index), or args.defaults = true to take the default"}], "structuredContent": {"id": 13, "ok": false, "cmd": "approx", "ucas": "approx sin(x) in 0..1", "structured": false, "notes": [], "conditions": [], "checks": [], "files": [], "text": "", "error": {"code": "ambiguous", "message": "sin(x) has special points at the interval's ends (at x = 0 it is 0): near a zero, relative error is unbounded unless the zero is exact; keep them exact (costs some error elsewhere)", "key": "keep_ends", "readings": [{"index": 1, "reading": "yes, keep them exact (keep endpoints)", "default": false}, {"index": 2, "reading": "no, fit freely", "default": true}], "how": "repeat the request with args.assume.keep_ends set to a reading (or its index), or args.defaults = true to take the default"}}, "isError": true}}
